---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: 2026 Challenge Intake
description: "Review the 2026 challenge, then sign it using the secure form directly below the document."
permalink: /2026-challenge-intake/index.html
ogType: website
---
{% set challengePdfPath = "/documents/2026-challenge.pdf" %}
{# Add the final PDF at static/documents/2026-challenge.pdf. Eleventy publishes it at the challengePdfPath above. #}
{# To change the reader to a different challenge PDF, upload the PDF into src/content/documents/static/documents/ and replace challengePdfPath above with /documents/<url-encoded-filename>.pdf. #}
<main id="main-content" data-pagefind-body>
  <section aria-labelledby="challenge-intake-heading" class="max-w-6xl mx-auto space-y-8">
    {% set sectionKicker = "2026" %}{% set sectionTitle = "Challenge Intake" %}{% set sectionId = "challenge-intake-heading" %}{% set sectionLevel = "h1" %}
    {% include "components/section-header.njk" %}

    <article class="card prose prose-lg max-w-none">
      <h2>Review the challenge, then sign below</h2>
      <p class="text-xl">
        Read the 2026 challenge in the document viewer. When you are ready, scroll to the signature form directly below the challenge to add your signature and submit your intake information.
      </p>
      <aside class="rounded-xl border-2 border-accent bg-surface-overlay p-4" aria-label="Signature eligibility">
        <p class="m-0"><strong>Eligibility:</strong> Only West Virginia Democrats in good standing may sign this challenge.</p>
      </aside>
      <p>
        If the document reader does not load, you can
        <a href="{{ challengePdfPath }}">open the challenge PDF directly</a>.
      </p>
    </article>

    <section class="card" aria-labelledby="challenge-pdf-heading">
      <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">
        <h2 id="challenge-pdf-heading">1. Review the challenge</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="mt-4 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-950" style="height: min(85vh, 900px); min-height: 620px;">
        <iframe
          src="{{ challengePdfPath }}#view=FitH"
          title="2026 challenge PDF reader"
          width="100%"
          height="100%"
          loading="eager"
          allowfullscreen
          style="border: 0; display: block; min-height: 620px;"
        ></iframe>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="card" aria-labelledby="signature-heading">
      <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">
        <h2 id="signature-heading">2. Sign the challenge</h2>
        <p>Use the secure Adobe form below to add your signature and submit your intake information.</p>
        <p><strong>Only West Virginia Democrats in good standing may sign.</strong></p>
      </div>
      <div class="mt-4 overflow-auto rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-950" style="height: min(90vh, 900px); min-height: 560px;">
        <iframe src="https://na3.documents.adobe.com/public/esignWidget?wid=CBFCIBAA3AAABLblqZhBI0WkAEG2sc2NOB7GWXtoMEqWaZCIHQ5uJpESXOtF4btS2YEVwb7ELIUo48PrAQvM*&hosted=false" width="100%" height="100%" frameborder="0" title="Adobe signature intake form" style="border: 0; overflow: hidden; min-height: 500px; min-width: 600px;"></iframe>
      </div>
    </section>
  </section>
</main>
